<%- include('./partials/navbar') %>

<section class="policy-page-section" style="padding: 40px 16px 80px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; color: var(--text-main, #1a1a1a);">
  <div class="policy-header" style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <span style="font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #2c7a4b; background: #e8f5ed; padding: 6px 14px; border-radius: 20px; display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 12px;">Delivery Guidelines</span>
    <h1 style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; margin: 0 0 12px; color: #1f5735;">Shipping Policy</h1>
    <p style="color: #6c757d; font-size: 15px;">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
  </div>

  <div class="policy-content" style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; border-radius: 16px; padding: 36px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.03); line-height: 1.7; font-size: 15px; color: #333;">
    
    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f5735; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 14px;">1. Delivery Zones & Order Minimums</h2>
    <p>To ensure prompt, fresh, and hygienic doorstep delivery, Shanmukha Stores operates tiered delivery zones:</p>
    
    <div style="overflow-x: auto; margin: 20px 0;">
      <table style="width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 14px;">
        <thead>
          <tr style="background: #e8f5ed; color: #1f5735; text-align: left;">
            <th style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d4ebd9;">Zone / Region</th>
            <th style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d4ebd9;">Coverage Area</th>
            <th style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d4ebd9;">Minimum Order</th>
            <th style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #d4ebd9;">Estimated Time</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; font-weight: 600;">Zone 1 (Local)</td>
            <td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e9ecef;">Vijayawada & Bezawada</td>
            <td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; color: #2c7a4b; font-weight: 700;">₹499</td>
            <td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e9ecef;">Same-Day / Next-Day</td>
          </tr>
          <tr style="background: #fafbfc;">
            <td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; font-weight: 600;">Zone 2 (All Other Locations)</td>
            <td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e9ecef;">All areas outside Vijayawada</td>
            <td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e9ecef; color: #2c7a4b; font-weight: 700;">₹899</td>
            <td style="padding: 12px; border: 1px solid #e9ecef;">1 – 3 Business Days</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f5735; margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 14px;">2. Order Processing & Dispatch</h2>
    <p>Orders placed before <strong>2:00 PM IST</strong> on business days are packed and dispatched the same afternoon. Orders placed on Sundays or public holidays are processed the next business morning.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f5735; margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 14px;">3. Packaging & Quality Assurance</h2>
    <p>All items—including fresh groceries, organic dry goods, and cold-pressed oils—are packaged in sealed, food-grade materials to prevent tampering, spills, or moisture degradation during transit.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f5735; margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 14px;">4. Order Tracking</h2>
    <p>Upon dispatch, live tracking updates are made available in your <a href="/orders" style="color: #2c7a4b; text-decoration: underline;">Orders Dashboard</a> and shared via WhatsApp notifications.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #1f5735; margin-top: 28px; margin-bottom: 14px;">5. Delivery Attempts & Rescheduling</h2>
    <p>Our courier/delivery agent will make up to two delivery attempts. Please ensure your delivery phone number is active and reachable during the delivery window.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('./partials/footer') %>
